      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPER IN (4) was a winner two back but last start drifted back and wound up strongly to finish a 1.75 lengths third at Richmond (23.15). Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Sure to be about the mark. MIGHTY HENRY (8) boasts a strong record this journey here with two wins and two minors from five tries. Missed the frame latest (22.80) when fourth over 400m at this track in a Grade 5. Looks one of the chances. CESSNOCK CURTAIN (3) comes off an average effort last start when sixth at this track over 400m behind Zipper Stride (22.78) in a Grade 5. The form out of last run is most impressive. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. POWER ROLEX (2) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
